NAME
  vtkSHYXAutoMeshRepair
DESCRIPTION
  "SHYX: Mesh Checker diagnostics + soup repair; optional two-stage extract/Alpha Wrap then union of self-intersection clusters."
GROUPS
  Meshing
DEPENDS
  vtkCGALAlgorithm
  vtkCGALPMP
  vtkSHYXMeshChecker
  vtkSHYXHoleFillFilter
  vtkSHYXSelectionFillAlphaReunionFilter
  VTK::FiltersCore
PRIVATE_DEPENDS
  VTK::CommonCore
  VTK::CommonDataModel
  VTK::CommonExecutionModel
